-+
-+  2008-06-17 Simon Goldschmidt
-+  * err.h: patch #6459: Made err_t overridable to use a more efficient type
-+    (define LWIP_ERR_T in cc.h)
-+
-+  2008-06-17 Simon Goldschmidt
-+  * slipif.c: patch #6480: Added a configuration option for slipif for symmetry
